    "with an Aviv 202SF CD spectrophotometer.",
    "Isothermal Titration Calorimetry (ITC) Measurement.",
    "A Nano ITC (TA Instruments) system was used to investigate the interactions between ISCU(M108I) and (NIA)  .",
    "Both (NIA)  and ISCU(M108I) were dialyzed extensively against HNT buffer.",
    "The sample cell (169 \u03bcL) contained 0.1 mM ISCU(M108I), and the syringe (50 \u03bcL) contained 1.1 mM (NIA) 2 .",
    "Twenty aliquots of 2.5 \u03bcL of (NIA)  were injected into the sample cell, and the heat generated after each injection was measured.",
    "NanoAnalyse software was used in processing and fitting the ITC data."
  ],
